# Niva — production landing page

## Architecture

- **Production:** `index.html` → GitHub `lachtomer/nivalandpage` → Vercel
- **Design lab (optional):** [Open Design](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design) — see `docs/OPEN-DESIGN-WORKFLOW.md`
- **Never** merge open-design monorepo into this project

## Brand contract

Read **`DESIGN.md`** (repo root) before visual changes.

| Token | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Primary | `#7c5454` |
| Secondary | `#8c4b55` |
| Surface | `#fff7fa` |
