## Content

- Brand: **איפור תרפי • Makeup Therapy**
- Copy source of truth: **`docs/design/content-map.md`** — do not paraphrase
- RTL: `lang="he"` `dir="rtl"` always

## Stack

- Static **`index.html`** + Tailwind CDN — no React/Next unless user requests migration
- Form: Formspree / Netlify Forms when connected
- Images: `assets/images/`

## Sections (current)

1. Header → 2. Hero `#about` → 3. About → 4. Workshops `#workshops` (3 cards) → 5. Contact `#contact` → 6. Footer

